eration.\",\n      \"Polymarket is simultaneously listing parlays while the SEC is seeking public input on prediction market ETFs, showing related speculative infrastructure expanding in parallel.\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_sources\": [\n      {\n        \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n        \"title\": \"Binance launches SpaceX pre-IPO perps amid $2 trillion valuation bets\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/binance-launches-spacex-pre-ipo-perps\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n        \"title\": \"Elon Musk's SpaceX holds 18,712 bitcoin at fair value of $1.29 billion, IPO filing shows\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/20/elon-musk-s-spacex-holds-18-712-bitcoin-at-fair-value-of-usd1-29-billion-ipo-filing-shows\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"source\": \"CoinDesk\",\n        \"title\": \"Polymarket moves to list parlays while SEC seeks public input on prediction market ETFs\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/20/polymarket-moves-to-list-parlays-while-sec-seeks-public-input-on-prediction-market-etfs\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"market_breadth_notes\": [\n    {\n      \"theme\": \"Bitcoin\",\n      \"note\": \"BTC is still a major reference point, but the bigger live narrative is the SpaceX IPO and the derivative/speculative products surrounding it.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"theme\": \"Ethereum / alt ecosystem\",\n      \"note\": \"Live coverage also flagged Ethereum privacy progress and Ethereum Foundation departures, but these are smaller than the SpaceX-led market structure story.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"theme\": \"Regulation\",\n      \"note\": \"US policy remains active via prediction markets, ETF review, master accounts, and crypto tax reform discussions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"theme\": \"Tokenization / TradFi convergence\",\n      \"note\": \"Securitize, AI Financial, and the SpaceX-linked pre-IPO products all point to continued convergence between crypto rails and traditional finance events.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"source_quality\": {\n    \"collection_method\": \"live web fetch of major crypto news homepages and article pages\",\n    \"notes\": \"Web search was rate-limited, so aggregation used direct outlet fetches from CoinDesk and a headline check from Cointelegraph.\"\n  }\n}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":4975,"output":1135,"cacheRead":10368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16478,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779351460469,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dhst2nVWN7YDaOXlF5vokWTZE79o0"}}
